00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.520
And may I have the last four digits of your social security?
能告诉我您社保号的后四位吗？

374
00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:00.920
6650.
6650。

375
00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:04.420
