00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.780
It's more of a moment when he stood up for Angela.
更像是他为安吉拉出头的那个瞬间。

389
00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.780
You sort of mentioned this earlier, Jenna, in your show Bible.
詹娜，你之前在你的剧集圣经里稍微提到过这个。

390
00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.780
It's from the episode Vandalism.
出自《破坏》那一集。

391
00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:43.200
And, you know, the senator and Angela have had all their fancy friends over to their house.
你们知道的，参议员和安吉拉请了他们那些上流朋友到家里做客。

392
00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.180
And they're getting this group photo with baby Philip.
他们正和婴儿菲利普拍合照。

393
00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:50.380
And Oscar and Angela are pushing each other and fighting to be in the front of the picture.
奥斯卡和安吉拉在互相推搡，争着要站在照片最前面。

394
00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:54.340
And as they leave, Kevin stands up for them to the senator.
等他们离开时，凯文在参议员面前为他们打抱不平。

395
00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:55.500
And here's the clip.
这段是音频片段。

396
00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:56.920
Thank you so much.
非常感谢。

397
00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:02.330
Well, have we all calmed down yet?
好了，大家现在都冷静下来了吗？

398
00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:03.030
Yes.
是的。

399
00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:04.090
Sorry about that.
真不好意思。

400
00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:06.050
It was all my fault.
全都是我的错。

401
00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:08.190
Let's all try to do better next time.
让我们下次都努力做得更好。

402
00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:09.890
Kevin, great to see you.
凯文，很高兴见到你。

403
00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:11.310
Thank you for the food.
谢谢你的食物。

404
00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:14.050
And also, you suck.
还有，你真烂。

405
00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:15.950
